    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up gasping for air, but your lungs burn as you cough up PFC fluid. Disoriented and alone, you find yourself trapped aboard a derelict space station. But you're not truly alone\u2014anomalous activity has consumed the station! Your only chance for survival lies in getting to <strong><i>HANGAR 8</i></strong> and escaping this looping nightmare before it\u2019s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/07b5caa652c442ad3e7c06b06578c92d.poster.avif?t=1747820531\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/07b5caa652c442ad3e7c06b06578c92d.webm?t=1747820531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/07b5caa652c442ad3e7c06b06578c92d.mp4?t=1747820531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is <i><strong>HANGAR 8 </strong></i>about, what do you do?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>HANGAR 8</i></strong> is a sci-fi walking simulator crossed with a spooky spot-the-difference game inspired by <i>The Exit 8</i>. Be on the look out for anomalies between levels 1 to 8, while using level 0 as a reference. Anomalies could be anything from something being not quite right in the environment, to deadly monsters and otherworldly entities. If you find an anomaly, turn back\u2014otherwise you just need to keep moving forward! <strong><i>HANGAR 8</i></strong> is all about creating a tense psychological horror atmosphere and getting you to question your sanity while collecting key items and reading lost crew logbooks in order to escape the looping nightmare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/c10c212b89fc5f41a964a5e8e6defe33.poster.avif?t=1747820531\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/c10c212b89fc5f41a964a5e8e6defe33.webm?t=1747820531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/c10c212b89fc5f41a964a5e8e6defe33.mp4?t=1747820531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can I expect from <i><strong>HANGAR 8</strong></i>?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A complete science-fiction psychological horror experience!</strong> <i>HANGAR 8</i> is a complete game solo-developed with passion, that has a beginning, middle, and a single ending. While there is only one ending, there are slight differences with each playthrough, as you discover all anomalies. Any possible future updates will be FREE!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>58 Anomalies To Discover,</strong> offering replay-ability for multiple escape attempts! If you spot an anomaly, it will never repeat until all fifty anomalies are found. <i>(There is a extra mode to enable all anomalies for a greater challenge!)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect the 6 key items required to escape</strong>, while finding 6 optional logbooks hidden throughout the space station to read for game lore!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/72440448e2d80e37bf40ebe81450f68a.poster.avif?t=1747820531\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/72440448e2d80e37bf40ebe81450f68a.webm?t=1747820531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/72440448e2d80e37bf40ebe81450f68a.mp4?t=1747820531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Objects</strong> will immerse you in this spooky spot-the-difference puzzle game. Explore the environment in order to figure out how to escape the cursed space station! You will need to look inside crates, or even turn on showers in order to verify that levels are clear of anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 to 120+ minutes for a single play-through</strong>, depending on your perceptive skills and how lucky you get with the random anomaly selection algorithm. <i>(Auto-save feature for if you want to take a break and continue later!)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Achievements to gain,</strong> one of which will test your speed running skills! HANGAR 8 has a built-in timer and an official leaderboard on  for those who want to challenge me (the dev) and optimise their escape times!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/2f9f4ab6a5f23c68717a3a9e2806752d.poster.avif?t=1747820531\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/2f9f4ab6a5f23c68717a3a9e2806752d.webm?t=1747820531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/2f9f4ab6a5f23c68717a3a9e2806752d.mp4?t=1747820531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Game By Solo Developer :3</p>",
