m; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/72440448e2d80e37bf40ebe81450f68a.mp4?t=1747820531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Objects</strong> will immerse you in this spooky spot-the-difference puzzle game. Explore the environment in order to figure out how to escape the cursed space station! You will need to look inside crates, or even turn on showers in order to verify that levels are clear of anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 to 120+ minutes for a single play-through</strong>, depending on your perceptive skills and how lucky you get with the random anomaly selection algorithm. <i>(Auto-save feature for if you want to take a break and continue later!)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Achievements to gain,</strong> one of which will test your speed running skills! HANGAR 8 has a built-in timer and an official leaderboard on  for those who want to challenge me (the dev) and optimise their escape times!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/2f9f4ab6a5f23c68717a3a9e2806752d.poster.avif?t=1747820531\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/2f9f4ab6a5f23c68717a3a9e2806752d.webm?t=1747820531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204650/extras/2f9f4ab6a5f23c68717a3a9e2806752d.mp4?t=1747820531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Game By Solo Developer :3</p>",
    "short_description": "HANGAR 8 is a psychological horror set within the unsettling confines of a derelict space station. Brave the looping corridors to get to level 8, discover all anomalies, collect key items, and escape the nightmare!",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian, Hindi",
    "reviews": "\u201cHangar 8 epitomizes the first-tilt, solo-dev offering that succeeds, offering a very solid, albeit brief experience in sci-fi psychological horror. While it draws clear inspiration from games like Exit 8 and the series I\u2019m on Observation Duty, it finds its own space and creates a distinctly memorable experience...\u201d<br>7.8 \u2013 Vogue Horror<br><br>\u201cThere are some terrifying anomalies to discover. Some of them can sneak up on you while others are in front of you but you know something terrible will happen. Both types of anomalies are fun to find and frightening to resolve.\u201d<br>Ties That Bind Gaming<br>",
